  "note": "What the ledger does not know, as SETS of identities. A member may leave; a new member fails CI. Sets rather than counts because a count is defeated by a swap — add one undocumented variant, document a different one, and the total is unchanged while the ledger knows strictly less about a new string. The guard also compares against the MERGE BASE, so raising the file in the same commit as the regression does not help. Raising requires a dated reason under `raised`. ADR-019 D8. Live: observations-status.py --unproven",
