      "reason": "#981: the ledger now credits a LabelSet member in a locale only when Apple ships it there up to case and nothing else. `pluginMenuAudioUnits` (`Audio\\u00a0Units`), `stemExportProgressWindowTitle` (`Logic\\u00a0Pro`) were derived in the base through `normalize`, which turns a no-break space into a space, and the es-ES corpus of Logic 12.3 (6674) ships only those no-break spellings. Foundation's `caseInsensitiveCompare` does not equate U+00A0 with U+0020, trimmed or not (measured 2026-09-25 on this Mac), so the members as written do not match those strings; the cells are unmeasured until a live reading shows what the running Logic displays."
